('math-statistics-standard-deviation-01','mathematics','statistics','Measures of dispersion','Standard deviation','Standard deviation is:','["the positive square root of variance","the square of variance","mean divided by variance","range divided by two"]',0,'Taking the positive square root returns the dispersion measure to the original units.','foundation',array['jee-main','tg-eapcet','ap-eapcet'],'published','NCERT Mathematics XI; official JEE Main and EAPCET syllabi',now(),'codex-phase3-review','1.0'),
